# The landing needs no variables: `pnpm dev` and `pnpm --filter landing build`
# work as they are. This file is a list, not a configuration: nothing reads an
# apps/landing/.env. Set a variable in the environment of the command, for
# example
#   PUBLIC_URL=https://example.com pnpm --filter landing build
#
# Everything the landing builds is public: never put a secret in one of these.
#
# The public origin of the site, for its canonical and alternate links, the
# sitemap and robots.txt: an origin only (https://example.com), no path, no
# trailing slash. Default: the dev and preview servers' http://localhost:4321.
# PUBLIC_URL=http://localhost:4321
